Subject: [PATCH] Docker Sandbox (#37)

Spec hoangvu12/zeron-nightly#37: chats run in Docker cloud sandboxes, a
sandbox provider kept by a host device, with templates, sleep and wake,
recovery and Start fresh. work/docker-sandbox-e2e at b53b39c2a (base
zeron/zgx c1539061b) merged onto the assembled v3 nightly, with what that
merge needed: both sides of 13 conflicted files kept, the child-reports
watch test's device row given online_since, sandboxes.wake blocked in
plugin previews, and zeron-v2's .base.json brought in step.
